│ patch_description        │ Extends the local search in two ways inspired by the recommendation: (1) instead of only  │
│                          │ targeting the single worst GPU, the move+swap loop runs over the k=2 highest-KVPR GPUs    │
│                          │ sequentially, so rebalancing between mid-tier GPUs becomes reachable; (2) when no single  │
│                          │ move/swap improves, try the best pair of swaps between the two worst GPUs. Keep           │
│                          │ everything else (greedy seed, strict-improvement gating, atomic state updates) the same   │
│                          │ for simplicity and correctness.                                                           │
