│ patch_name               │ swap_and_2for1_local_search                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ Extend the existing multi-start greedy + move-based local search with two additional      │
│                          │ neighborhood operators: (1) 1-for-1 swaps between the hot (max-KVPR) GPU and any other    │
│                          │ GPU, and (2) 2-for-1 exchanges where one model on the hot GPU is replaced by two smaller  │
│                          │ models from another GPU (and vice versa). Each candidate is checked for memory            │
│                          │ feasibility, and accepted only if the resulting global max KVPR strictly improves by      │
│                          │ >1e-12. This handles size-vs-rate asymmetries that moves alone cannot fix (e.g., the hot  │
│                          │ GPU holds a large low-rate model while another GPU holds two small high-rate models).     │
