╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ add_3way_rotation_operator                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Add a bounded 3-way cyclic rotation as a fourth candidate operator in the local search    │
│                          │ scan. Moves and swaps can't escape optima where hot must receive a model from B while a   │
│                          │ model on hot goes to A and one from A goes to B. After the move/swap/swap2 scans, if no   │
│                          │ op was found (to keep runtime bounded), try rotations: for each model on hot, each        │
│                          │ destination A, each model on A, each destination B, and each model on B that fits hot's   │
│                          │ freed space. Compute the three affected GPUs' new KVPRs and accept the best strict        │
│                          │ improvement. Apply atomically with symmetric load/free_mem updates.                       │
